+    // A server can also hand out a folder it already has as one more mod (the multiplayer mod's own client scripts, so they are
+    // not stored twice): only its scripts, l10n and textures folders are offered, plus an empty <id>.omwscripts so that the
+    // client adds the folder to its data directories without loading anything twice. A folder <root>/<id> wins over it.
